0390DEFINE DATA /* =========================================================
0400*
0410*
0420PARAMETER USING A9013Q06
0430*
0440LOCAL
0450*
0460** ----- <WAX> Auxiliares ------------------------------------------- **
0470*
04801 WAX-CODG-SITC                    (A002)
04901 WAX-DESC-SITC                    (A015)
05001 WAX-FILD-EDIT                    (A015)
0510*
0520** ----- <WIN> Indexadores ------------------------------------------ **
0530*
05401 WIN-PESK                         (N007)
0550*
0560** ----- <WTB> Tabelas Internas ------------------------------------- **
0570*
05801 WTB-CODG-SITC                    (A20/20) INIT
0590(01) <'01:REGISTRADA'>
0600(02) <'02:APROVADA  '>
0610(03) <'03:EMITIDA   '>
0620(04) <'04:ACATADA   '>
0630(05) <'05:REPROVADA '>
0640(06) <'06:REAVALIADA'>
0650(07) <'07:DEVOLVIDA '>
0660(08) <'09:APROVADA  '>
